{"name": "Dry Sea", "description": "<div class=\"game_area_description\" id=\"game_area_description\">\n<h2>About This Game</h2>\n<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Dry Sea is a retro run &amp; gun, where every gun has multiple functions,</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"360\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4094690/extras/18ee5f1212c202632bafee89a92475a3.poster.avif?t=1780234303\" width=\"960\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4094690/extras/18ee5f1212c202632bafee89a92475a3.webm?t=1780234303\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4094690/extras/18ee5f1212c202632bafee89a92475a3.mp4?t=1780234303\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The sea dried up and all the fauna had to adapt to survive. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Control Jorge, an axolotl with huge eyes who had his car stolen.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"300\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4094690/extras/ab2131163f7e81dd5695ee064f25aac9.poster.avif?t=1780234303\" width=\"800\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4094690/extras/ab2131163f7e81dd5695ee064f25aac9.webm?t=1780234303\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4094690/extras/ab2131163f7e81dd5695ee064f25aac9.mp4?t=1780234303\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Explore this vast world in search of your car and </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">find secrets and funny NPCs.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"300\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4094690/extras/9e11a2f2f4c5ecd0888644111b198ffc.poster.avif?t=1780234303\" width=\"800\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4094690/extras/9e11a2f2f4c5ecd0888644111b198ffc.webm?t=1780234303\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4094690/extras/9e11a2f2f4c5ecd0888644111b198ffc.mp4?t=1780234303\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Find weapons with varied abilities</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> Shoot anything that moves</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Go find your car </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Control a big-eyed axolotl</p></li></ul> </div>", "short_desc": "After having his brand-new car stolen by bandits, Jorge leaves home determined; shotgun in one arm and thousands of cartridges in the other, and he won't rest until he gets his car back from those evildoers.", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4094690/f5dbc74f4428415e946672bf01c1ab7e07da6536/header.jpg?t=1780234303", "screenshots": [], "tags": ["Western", "Shooter", "Retro", "Shoot 'Em Up", "2D Platformer", "Action"], "developers": "Willian Saturny", "publishers": "Willian Saturny", "release_date": "To be announced", "price": "Coming Soon", "appid": "4094690", "review_type": "Informational", "curator_desc": "30 April 2026 - Demo", "yt_link": "https://youtu.be/qhQNztBaPlI", "first_seen": 1777500000.0, "review_rank": 760}